title: "AfrPowerOS — African Nuclear & Energy Infrastructure Intelligence"
abstract: >
  Open, cited intelligence on civilian nuclear-energy and energy-infrastructure
  programs across Africa: programme phase, IAEA milestone status, regulators,
  implementing agencies, planned capacity, vendors, agreements, research
  reactors, and key events.
